  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1376f052a41f43242b6634233346e3e4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Right3.1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueLine
  speakerName: ROXANNE
  line: Guard 2 signed off his post at one-oh-five. His own log. His own handwriting.
    He told you he was at the base of those stairs from one o'clock until half past.
    His log says he left at one-oh-five. Those two things cannot both be true. I'm
    not saying you're lying. I'm saying you were the only set of eyes on those stairs,
    in the dark, at one in the morning, and you might be wrong. And wrong is enough.
